'''Volcarona''' (Japanese: '''ウルガモス''' ''Ulgamoth'') is a {{ct|Fire}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion.

