==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|BW Promo|Volcarona|40}}, one of the {{TCG|BW Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Volcanic Ash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua|Blaziken ex|89}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Magma vs Team Aqua}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

